    {
      "id": "987065",
      "title": "React Native Keynote",
      "description": "Join us for the React Native Keynote @ ReactConf 2025, where the React team will share what we've been building for React Native and where the framework is headed next.\r\n\r\nFrom major improvements to the core architecture to new tools that make building native apps faster and more seamless—we're excited to show you what’s coming. \r\n\r\nWhether you're shipping apps at scale or just curious to learn more about React Native, this is a keynote you don’t want to miss.",
