      "id": "1020632",
      "title": "Designing Page Transitions",
      "description": "Learn how to use React’s new View Transitions APIs to make page navigations feel clean, fast, and polished. We will start with a simple Next.js page, add crossfade, direction, shared elements, speed, blur, accessibility, and more! In 10 minutes, you will leave with animation patterns you can reuse in any app.",
