      "id": "947075",
      "title": "What's The Framework of the React Future?",
      "description": "The React ecosystem is at a crossroads. With Server Components reshaping how we think about full-stack development, meta-frameworks multiplying faster than JavaScript build tools, and new paradigms emerging weekly, developers are asking: Where is this all heading? What React framework will reign supreme in 2026 and beyond!",
