      "bio": "Shruti is a Software Engineer and a YouTuber. She is passionate about teaching Shruti Kapoor is a seasoned frontend engineer, educator, and speaker who's been leet-heatin' her way through the dev world for over a decade. Formerly at PayPal and Slack, and a full-time content creator, she's best known for breaking down complex topics like React 18 and 19 with clarity, humor, and the occasional DevJoke (aka: *Hip Hip Array!*).\r\n\r\nShruti is an Egghead and O’Reilly instructor, international speaker, and the creator of [*This Week in React and AI*](https://shrutikapoor.substack.com/) - a newsletter packed with sharp insights and terrible puns. She’s been featured on global stages, and built a community of developers who genuinely enjoy learning about accessibility, AI, and React—sometimes all at once.\r\n\r\nWhen she’s not deep in code or keynoting a conference, you’ll probably find her traveling the world, sipping coffee, and being effortlessly cooler than your favorite devand sharing knowledge in JavaScript, React, GraphQL and front-end technologies. She creates technical content and shares at shrutikapoor.dev. She is also an ardent #DevJoke fan.\r\n",
